amounts just under the limit is a statistical indicator. It does not prove that any contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["n%2F8%2FN%2F4kIp6OUi78BmzhOQ%3D%3D","MNV82xHCo%2FlJ8Trn0ZPzLw%3D%3D","3RYdxXC5aui8ebB%2FXTwy0A%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}